resources.string:
Want the app icon to be your own photo?

1. Pick 1~3 images you like (square works best);
2. Send them to %1$s (subject: "custom icon"), or send directly via WeChat: %2$s;
3. We will reply within 3 days with a custom install package — the first image becomes the launcher icon, the rest appear under "My images" to switch freely.

Your images are only used to build your custom package. If you get no reply within 3 days, please send again. Thank you!
